# Required. A secret salt mixed into the hash that turns a family code into a
# blob key. Without it, anyone who can list the blob store could brute-force the
# stored keys offline and recover family codes.
#
# Generate one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
#
# Set the SAME value locally and in the Netlify UI
# (Site configuration → Environment variables). Changing it after launch makes
# every existing family code stop resolving — treat it as permanent.
FAMILY_CODE_PEPPER=
